abstract_en:
The purpose of the study is to scientific developing theoretical and methodological principles and 
 recommendations for activating the social and labor potential in Ukraine as factors of sustainable economic 
 growth. Scientific results of the research: methodological principles of activating the social and labor potential of 
 sustainable development; scientific and methodological recommendations on issues of economic and social policy; 
 models of development of social-labor relations from conflict interaction to constructive partnership; 
 recommendations on the development of labor potential of industry in the context of neo-industrialization; 
 priority directions and mechanisms of accumulation of human capital for sustainable economic development; 
 strategic priorities of social policy on the enhancement of Ukraine's labor potential for sustainable development.

An efficient numerical method and the created numerical algorithms for solving problems on the propagation of 
 plane elastic waves in layered composite materials with uniform initial stresses when the layers slip are developed; 
 numerical solutions of the investigated problems have been obtained.

An efficient numerical method and the created numerical algorithms for solving problems on the propagation of 
 plane elastic waves in layered composite materials with uniform initial stresses when the layers slip are developed; 
 numerical solutions of the investigated problems have been obtained.

The state of using pulverized coal (PWT) in blast furnace smelting is analyzed. Investigation of the efficiency of the 
 use of PUT, oxidation of cast iron on tuyeres and heat loss with cooling water and colonic gas from the parameters 
 of blast furnace smelting. A mathematical model, an algorithm and a system for optimizing the flow of PUT for 
 blast furnace smelting have been developed. The system consists of subsystems: information reliability control; 
 stabilization of the theoretical combustion temperature; heat loss and oxidation of cast iron on tuyeres; 
 stabilization of the thermal state of the smelting process; Optimization of PUT and blowing.

